        answer: "Autotraced graphics often consist of separate overlapping colored shapes. When sent to a plotter, the blade follows every internal path edge. To fix this, select the overlapping shapes and click 'Weld' (Ctrl+Shift+U) to merge them into a single solid outer boundary.",
