        answer: "Artistic Text is created by clicking once with the Text Tool and is ideal for short headlines, titles, and logos; it scales freely without wrapping. Paragraph Text is created by dragging a text bounding box and is used for large blocks of copy, supporting automatic column wrapping and justification.",
